  "releaseNotes": "First public release of Vane.Logging.Mel, published as 1.0.0. Entry points: AddVaneLog / AddVaneLogWithReload attach an existing ILogManager to the host; AddVaneLogManager / AddVaneLogManagerWithReload let the container own the manager and reload it from IConfiguration. Core API carries no Vane prefix; Vane appears as the namespace root only. The Vane.Logging config section is the primary source. The MEL provider alias is \"Vane.Logging\". See CHANGELOG.md.",
